	 (5204,1,0,'You inspect the body, and there is no doubt that these are the remains of the Knight of the Silver Hand, Trey Lightforge. For a moment you think of Arko''narin and question if anyone in your life meant as much to you as this man meant to the Night elf captive you recently helped escape Shadow Hold.$B$BAfter taking another moment to gather your thoughts, you know that you cannot take the paladin''s remains back to Jessir without killing his torturer first.',12340);
