	 (7811,1,1,'$n, you''ve been a tremendous contributor to our cloth drive. As we work hard to replenish our reserves, one form of cloth remains critically low - runecloth. We are in absolutely dire need of it, and we hope that you will be able to help us as you have in the past!$b$bIf you are willing, please bring me what runecloth you can spare. We''ll initially accept a single donation of sixty, and then we''ll go from there.',12340);
